		(property "Description" "ATmega32u2\n\n• Pin compatible with the atmega8u2, atmega16u2 and atmega32u2\n• 8, 16 or 32 K flash, 1K RAM, 512b EEPROM\n• 8 bit and 16 bit timer (5 PWM total)\n• UART, SPI (no I2C!)\n• USB with 4 endpoints, LUFA compatible\n• 22 I/O lines, analog comparator (no ADC!)\n• Comes with DFU bootloader burned in!"
